  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Position of an ant ( <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> in metres) moving in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></math> plane is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> (where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> is in second). The magnitude and direction of velocity of the ant at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> will be :</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "O3Oe0",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> in y-direction",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "VEBIs",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-direction",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "uAaUW",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> in z-direction",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "X94FQ",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-direction",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The velocity of the ant can be found as follows:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mover><mi>S</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>, from equation (1), it follows that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p>",
